@startuml UC7_VisualizePath_Design
autonumber "<b>0:"
title [UC7] Visualization of a Path

' =======================================================
' COMPONENT DEFINITION
' =======================================================
actor "User" as User
participant "Mobile Application\n(Tier 1)" as Client

' Backend System
participant "BBP API Gateway\n(Tier 2)" as GW
box "BBP Application Server (Tier 3)" #LightBlue
    ' Usiamo SearchEngine coerentemente con UC6
    participant "PathSearchEngine" as Search
end box
participant "BBP BikePath DB\n(Tier 4)" as DB

' =======================================================
' ENTRY CONDITION
' =======================================================
note over User, Client: Entry Condition: User has selected a path and pressed "View"

' =======================================================
' (a) SYSTEM SHOWS DETAILS
' =======================================================
User -> Client: pressView(pathID)
activate Client

' Check cache locale (Opzionale, Smart Client optimization)
alt Details not cached locally
    note right of Client: Fetching aggregated data
    Client -> GW: GET /api/paths/{pathID}/full
    activate GW
    
    note right of GW: Routing to Search Engine
    GW -> Search: getPathDetails(pathID)
    deactivate GW
    activate Search

    ' Recupero Dati Aggregati (Punto critico del Design)
    note right of Search: Fetch Path Entity + Related Streets + Scores
    Search -> DB: fetchPathAndSegments(pathID)
    activate DB
    DB --> Search: FullPathEntity (Nested Data)
    deactivate DB

    ' Trasformazione in DTO
    Search -> Search: createFullPathDTO(FullPathEntity)

    Search --> GW: 200 OK (FullPathDTO)
    deactivate Search
    activate GW
    GW --> Client: 200 OK (FullPathDTO)
    deactivate GW
end

' Rendering Lato Client
note right of Client: Client renders geometry and colors based on score
Client -> Client: renderMapGeometry(pathData.segments)
Client -> Client: displayMetrics(pathData.scores)

Client --> User: displayPathDetails(Map, Stats)

' =======================================================
' EXIT CONDITION
' =======================================================
User -> Client: pressExit()

' Pulizia vista
Client -> Client: closeDetailView()
Client --> User: returnToPreviousScreen()

note over User, Client: Exit Condition: User closes the details view

deactivate Client
@enduml